{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24257","headline":"送姚杭州赴任因思旧游二首 一 · 白居易","name":"送姚杭州赴任因思旧游二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君细话杭州事，爲我留心莫等闲。\n闾里固宜勤抚恤，楼台亦要数跻攀。\n笙歌缥缈虚空里，风月依稀梦想间。\n且喜诗人重管领，遥飞一醆贺江山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}